window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/owner-courses/b252-7ae9cda5abb33c9d.json"]={sha256:"7ae9cda5abb33c9da6d07c99f5ceb37f70e0c4f82db640d0efd110c4549db9d3",value:{"id":"b252","title":"大壩止水帶施工","titleEn":"Dam waterstop installation","category":"water","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"本課以以接縫變形材料接續與澆置品質形成連續止水為主線，先用水壓高度與接縫與接縫張開與伸長界定水力與構造條件，再將定位支撐與覆蓋、狹縫層流與敏感度連結到壓力保持與量測誤差。數值均為材料幾何與水量盤點，不能替代止水帶產品試驗、接縫設計與壓力驗證。 每單元以原創算例、量測與失效辨識共同檢查推論。","summaryEn":"This course develops forming continuous water barriers through joint movement splicing and placement quality through Head pressure and joints and Joint opening and extension, then connects Positioning support and cover and Slot flow and sensitivity to Pressure holding and measurement error. Numbers describe geometry and water accounting, not substitutes for product testing joint design and pressure verification. Each unit combines original calculation, measurement and failure diagnosis to test the inference.","scope":"依公開工程原理、官方資料與規範架構編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是設計圖說、施工計畫、開挖、注漿或受限空間作業許可，也不是任何專案的設計文件。數值均為教學假設或公開資料，實際工程須由合格技師依規範與實測資料重新計算並簽證。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public engineering principles, official sources and code frameworks. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not design drawings, method statements, excavation, grouting or confined-space permits, or any project's design documents. Numbers are teaching assumptions or public data; real work must be recalculated and certified by qualified engineers using codes and measured data.","subcategory":"water-hydraulics","subcategoryTitle":"壩工監測、溢洪與壓力水路","subcategoryTitleEn":"Dam monitoring, spillways and pressure waterways","learningTrack":"water","learningSubdiscipline":"water-hydraulics","learningTags":["water","water-hydraulics","water"],"architectureFamily":"water-hydraulic","architectureNodes":[["水壓高度與接縫","Head pressure and joints"],["溫度收縮與位移","Thermal contraction and movement"],["定位支撐與覆蓋","Positioning support and cover"],["狹縫層流與敏感度","Slot flow and sensitivity"],["壓力保持與量測誤差","Pressure holding and measurement error"]],"architectureEdges":[[0,1],[1,2],[2,3],[3,4],[0,3]],"diagram":{"type":"water-hydraulic","labels":["水壓高度與接縫","溫度收縮與位移","定位支撐與覆蓋","狹縫層流與敏感度","壓力保持與量測誤差"],"labelsEn":["Head pressure and joints","Thermal contraction and movement","Positioning support and cover","Slot flow and sensitivity","Pressure holding and measurement error"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"整合算例輸入全為教學假設，先檢查水壓高度與接縫：waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa；再獨立檢查接縫張開與伸長：Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless。敏感度：平行板層流缺口由0.20增至0.30mm且其餘條件不變，理想滲流量按三次方增加至3.375倍；實際粗糙接縫、湍流與曲折流路不一定遵守此比例。 兩個結果須按各自量綱解釋，不能直接相加或當成完整設計。數值均為材料幾何與水量盤點，不能替代止水帶產品試驗、接縫設計與壓力驗證。 將比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤作為獨立驗證，明確列出尚缺的現地輸入及其對結論的影響。","textEn":"Every input in this integrated example is a teaching assumption. First examine Head pressure and joints: waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa. Independently examine Joint opening and extension: Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless. Sensitivity: increasing a parallel-plate laminar gap from0.20 to0.30mm at fixed conditions multiplies ideal flow by3.375. Real rough joints, turbulent flow and tortuous paths need not follow this cubic relation. Interpret each result in its own dimensions rather than adding them or treating them as a complete design. Numbers describe geometry and water accounting, not substitutes for product testing joint design and pressure verification. Use the following independent check: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Identify missing field inputs and state which conclusions depend on them.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表任何專案的設計值、量測值或規範允許值；改變系統邊界或荷載組合後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not any project's design values, measurements or code allowances; recalculate after changing the system boundary or load combination.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與工程背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and project context, not these numbers."},"depth":5,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":15,"enrichmentVersion":15,"stages":[{"id":"b252-v15-s1","title":"水文條件、邊界與工程系統","titleEn":"Hydrology, boundaries and engineering system","description":"本階段聚焦「水壓高度與接縫」與「接縫張開與伸長」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Head pressure and joints\" and \"Joint opening and extension\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b252-v15-01","title":"水壓高度與接縫：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Head pressure and joints: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「水壓高度與接縫」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Head pressure and joints” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"止水帶阻斷收縮縫或施工縫中的連通水路，所承受壓差與實際連通水頭相關。水深乘單位重只給靜水壓量級，不代表接縫任何點都處於同樣壓力；排水、局部缺陷與瞬變需另外辨識，才能確認試驗工況。 驗證時應對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差，並辨識以下失效情境：下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「水壓高度與接縫」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Waterstops interrupt connected paths through joints. Differential pressure depends on the connected head, not merely a nearby water level. Depth times unit weight provides a hydrostatic scale; drainage, defects and transients create different local conditions and must be identified before defining a test case. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Head pressure and joints” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「水壓高度與接縫」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Head pressure and joints”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-01-k1","title":"水壓高度與接縫","titleEn":"Head pressure and joints","text":"止水帶阻斷收縮縫或施工縫中的連通水路，所承受壓差與實際連通水頭相關。水深乘單位重只給靜水壓量級，不代表接縫任何點都處於同樣壓力；排水、局部缺陷與瞬變需另外辨識，才能確認試驗工況。","textEn":"Waterstops interrupt connected paths through joints. Differential pressure depends on the connected head, not merely a nearby water level.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「水壓高度與接縫」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Head pressure and joints\" is correct?","options":["附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差","止水帶阻斷收縮縫或施工縫中的連通水路，所承受壓差與實際連通水頭相關。","止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度"],"optionsEn":["Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location","Waterstops interrupt connected paths through joints.","Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile"],"answer":1,"explanation":"止水帶阻斷收縮縫或施工縫中的連通水路，所承受壓差與實際連通水頭相關。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Waterstops interrupt connected paths through joints. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"b252-v15-02","title":"水壓高度與接縫：定量估算","titleEn":"Head pressure and joints: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「水壓高度與接縫」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Head pressure and joints” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「水壓高度與接縫」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Head pressure and joints\", which statement holds?","options":["接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合","止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水","原創教學假設：waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa。"],"optionsEn":["A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section","An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak","Original teaching assumptions: waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: waterHead=35 m; gammaWater=9.81 kN/m3; hydrostaticPressure=35*9.81=343.35 kPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"b252-v15-03","title":"水壓高度與接縫：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Head pressure and joints: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「水壓高度與接縫」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Head pressure and joints” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-03-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「水壓高度與接縫」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Head pressure and joints\"?","options":["對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力"],"optionsEn":["Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure"],"answer":0,"explanation":"對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"b252-v15-04","title":"水壓高度與接縫：失效診斷","titleEn":"Head pressure and joints: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「水壓高度與接縫」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Head pressure and joints” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布。診斷時應採取以下查核：對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. Diagnose it by the following check: Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布。診斷時應採取以下查核：對照接縫位置庫水位與下游排水壓力界定壓差，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. Diagnose it by the following check: Use joint elevation, reservoir level and downstream drainage pressure to define differential head. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「水壓高度與接縫」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Head pressure and joints\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布。","止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint.","Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile"],"answer":1,"explanation":"下游排水堵塞會改變原先假設的接縫壓力分布。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Blocked drainage changes the assumed pressure distribution along the joint. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"b252-v15-05","title":"接縫張開與伸長：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Joint opening and extension: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-04"],"objective":"說明「接縫張開與伸長」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Joint opening and extension” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"止水帶需配合接縫張開與剪切，活動區長度決定同樣位移對材料的平均應變。中心泡管可透過幾何變形吸收位移，因此直條拉伸式只示範尺度，不能當所有型式的應變分析；轉角與交叉點通常需單獨檢查。 驗證時應量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗，並辨識以下失效情境：把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「接縫張開與伸長」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Waterstops accommodate opening and shear. Active length determines the mean strain for a prescribed displacement, while a center bulb deforms geometrically. A straight-strip estimate illustrates scale rather than every product shape; corners and intersections require separate checks because they constrain deformation differently. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Joint opening and extension” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless.","failure":"常見誤解：「止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「接縫張開與伸長」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Joint opening and extension”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-05-k1","title":"接縫張開與伸長","titleEn":"Joint opening and extension","text":"止水帶需配合接縫張開與剪切，活動區長度決定同樣位移對材料的平均應變。中心泡管可透過幾何變形吸收位移，因此直條拉伸式只示範尺度，不能當所有型式的應變分析；轉角與交叉點通常需單獨檢查。","textEn":"Waterstops accommodate opening and shear. Active length determines the mean strain for a prescribed displacement, while a center bulb deforms geometrically.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「接縫張開與伸長」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Joint opening and extension\" is correct?","options":["止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度","自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開","止水帶需配合接縫張開與剪切，活動區長度決定同樣位移對材料的平均應變。"],"optionsEn":["Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile","Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field","Waterstops accommodate opening and shear."],"answer":2,"explanation":"止水帶需配合接縫張開與剪切，活動區長度決定同樣位移對材料的平均應變。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Waterstops accommodate opening and shear. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"b252-v15-06","title":"接縫張開與伸長：定量估算","titleEn":"Joint opening and extension: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「接縫張開與伸長」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Joint opening and extension” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「接縫張開與伸長」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Joint opening and extension\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless。","澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變","任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless.","Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting","Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Ideal straight activeLength=80 mm; jointOpeningIncrease=6 mm; nominalStrain=6/80=0.075 dimensionless. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"b252-v15-07","title":"接縫張開與伸長：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Joint opening and extension: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「接縫張開與伸長」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Joint opening and extension” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-07-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「接縫張開與伸長」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Joint opening and extension\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗。","修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests.","A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed"],"answer":1,"explanation":"量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"b252-v15-08","title":"接縫張開與伸長：失效診斷","titleEn":"Joint opening and extension: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「接縫張開與伸長」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Joint opening and extension” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變。診斷時應採取以下查核：量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. Diagnose it by the following check: Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變。診斷時應採取以下查核：量測接縫張開與剪切並對照產品完整型式變形試驗，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. Diagnose it by the following check: Measure joint opening and shear and compare with full-profile product deformation tests. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「接縫張開與伸長」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Joint opening and extension\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開","把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field","Using total strip width as active length understates local strain."],"answer":2,"explanation":"把總帶寬當有效伸長區會低估局部應變。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Using total strip width as active length understates local strain. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"b252-v15-s2","title":"水力機制、材料與定量模型","titleEn":"Hydraulics, materials and quantitative models","description":"本階段聚焦「溫度收縮與位移」與「焊接接續與搭接」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Thermal contraction and movement\" and \"Splice continuity and joining\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b252-v15-09","title":"溫度收縮與位移：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and movement: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-08"],"objective":"說明「溫度收縮與位移」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Thermal contraction and movement” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"混凝土降溫會使接縫張開，但相鄰塊體的約束與溫度分布影響實際位移。自由熱縮量只能提供上限或參考尺度，不能直接等同現場縫寬；監測需同時記錄溫度與接縫位移，分辨季節循環與不可逆變形。 驗證時應比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化，並辨識以下失效情境：將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「溫度收縮與位移」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Cooling can open joints, but restraint and temperature distribution govern actual movement. Free thermal contraction supplies a reference scale rather than the installed joint width. Record temperature and displacement together to distinguish seasonal cycling from irreversible change and avoid attributing every movement to temperature alone. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Thermal contraction and movement” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「溫度收縮與位移」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Thermal contraction and movement”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-09-k1","title":"溫度收縮與位移","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and movement","text":"混凝土降溫會使接縫張開，但相鄰塊體的約束與溫度分布影響實際位移。自由熱縮量只能提供上限或參考尺度，不能直接等同現場縫寬；監測需同時記錄溫度與接縫位移，分辨季節循環與不可逆變形。","textEn":"Cooling can open joints, but restraint and temperature distribution govern actual movement. Free thermal contraction supplies a reference scale rather than the installed joint width.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「溫度收縮與位移」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Thermal contraction and movement\" is correct?","options":["混凝土降溫會使接縫張開，但相鄰塊體的約束與溫度分布影響實際位移。","自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開","接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合"],"optionsEn":["Cooling can open joints, but restraint and temperature distribution govern actual movement.","Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field","A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section"],"answer":0,"explanation":"混凝土降溫會使接縫張開，但相鄰塊體的約束與溫度分布影響實際位移。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Cooling can open joints, but restraint and temperature distribution govern actual movement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"b252-v15-10","title":"溫度收縮與位移：定量估算","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and movement: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「溫度收縮與位移」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Thermal contraction and movement” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「溫度收縮與位移」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Thermal contraction and movement\", which statement holds?","options":["止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水","原創教學假設：freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m。","自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力"],"optionsEn":["An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak","Original teaching assumptions: freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m.","Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: freeBlockLength=20 m; alpha=10e-6 perK; cooling=15 K; freeContraction=20*10e-6*15=0.003 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"b252-v15-11","title":"溫度收縮與位移：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and movement: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「溫度收縮與位移」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Thermal contraction and movement” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-11-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「溫度收縮與位移」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Thermal contraction and movement\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出","比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked","Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes."],"answer":2,"explanation":"比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"b252-v15-12","title":"溫度收縮與位移：失效診斷","titleEn":"Thermal contraction and movement: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「溫度收縮與位移」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Thermal contraction and movement” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動。診斷時應採取以下查核：比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動。診斷時應採取以下查核：比對塊體溫度與接縫計時序並標記約束變化，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare block temperatures and joint-meter histories and identify restraint changes. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「溫度收縮與位移」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Thermal contraction and movement\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合"],"optionsEn":["Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section"],"answer":0,"explanation":"將自由熱縮直接當縫寬會忽略相鄰塊體共同移動。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Equating free contraction with gap width ignores common movement of adjacent blocks. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"b252-v15-13","title":"焊接接續與搭接：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Splice continuity and joining: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-12"],"objective":"說明「焊接接續與搭接」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Splice continuity and joining” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"熱塑止水帶需用適用程序形成連續熔接，金屬或其他材料則需對應接續方式。接合面積乘名義應力只是一項示意，實際接頭的缺口、污染與型式變形會控制失效；應檢查完整剖面而非只看表面接縫漂亮。 驗證時應保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數，並辨識以下失效情境：外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「焊接接續與搭接」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Thermoplastic waterstops need qualified fusion procedures, while metal and other materials use different joining methods. Area times nominal stress is illustrative only; notches, contamination and profile deformation can govern failure. Inspect the full section rather than judging the joint by surface appearance alone. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Splice continuity and joining” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa.","failure":"常見誤解：「接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「焊接接續與搭接」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Splice continuity and joining”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-13-k1","title":"焊接接續與搭接","titleEn":"Splice continuity and joining","text":"熱塑止水帶需用適用程序形成連續熔接，金屬或其他材料則需對應接續方式。接合面積乘名義應力只是一項示意，實際接頭的缺口、污染與型式變形會控制失效；應檢查完整剖面而非只看表面接縫漂亮。","textEn":"Thermoplastic waterstops need qualified fusion procedures, while metal and other materials use different joining methods. Area times nominal stress is illustrative only; notches, contamination and profile deformation can govern failure.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「焊接接續與搭接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Splice continuity and joining\" is correct?","options":["接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合","熱塑止水帶需用適用程序形成連續熔接，金屬或其他材料則需對應接續方式。","澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變"],"optionsEn":["A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section","Thermoplastic waterstops need qualified fusion procedures, while metal and other materials use different joining methods.","Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting"],"answer":1,"explanation":"熱塑止水帶需用適用程序形成連續熔接，金屬或其他材料則需對應接續方式。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Thermoplastic waterstops need qualified fusion procedures, while metal and other materials use different joining methods. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"b252-v15-14","title":"焊接接續與搭接：定量估算","titleEn":"Splice continuity and joining: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「焊接接續與搭接」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Splice continuity and joining” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「焊接接續與搭接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Splice continuity and joining\", which statement holds?","options":["任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律","修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉","原創教學假設：Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa。"],"optionsEn":["Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law","A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed","Original teaching assumptions: Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Illustrative tensile coupon: bondedArea=120 mm2; failureLoad=1800 N; nominalStress=1800/120=15 MPa. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"b252-v15-15","title":"焊接接續與搭接：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Splice continuity and joining: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「焊接接續與搭接」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Splice continuity and joining” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-15-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「焊接接續與搭接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Splice continuity and joining\"?","options":["保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差"],"optionsEn":["Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location"],"answer":0,"explanation":"保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"b252-v15-16","title":"焊接接續與搭接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Splice continuity and joining: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「焊接接續與搭接」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Splice continuity and joining” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔。診斷時應採取以下查核：保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. Diagnose it by the following check: Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔。診斷時應採取以下查核：保留接頭試片破壞位置與斷面影像並核對製程參數，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. Diagnose it by the following check: Retain coupon failure locations and section images and check joining-process records. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「焊接接續與搭接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Splice continuity and joining\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔。","澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids.","Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting"],"answer":1,"explanation":"外觀平整仍可能存在未熔合或內部氣孔。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A smooth exterior can conceal incomplete fusion or internal voids. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"b252-v15-s3","title":"施工方法與施工階段控制","titleEn":"Construction methods and stage control","description":"本階段聚焦「定位支撐與覆蓋」與「混凝土包覆與空洞」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Positioning support and cover\" and \"Concrete encapsulation and voids\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b252-v15-17","title":"定位支撐與覆蓋：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Positioning support and cover: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-16"],"objective":"說明「定位支撐與覆蓋」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Positioning support and cover” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"止水帶需在澆置期間保持中心位置與足夠埋入深度，偏移會縮短繞流路徑或露出翼緣。幾何覆蓋扣減可示範誤差餘量，但還需考慮轉角和施工接續；支撐方式不可任意穿刺主要止水區造成新滲漏點。 驗證時應澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點，並辨識以下失效情境：澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「定位支撐與覆蓋」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The strip must retain its center and embedment during placement. Displacement shortens bypass paths or exposes ribs. A geometric cover deduction shows tolerance consumption but does not address corners and intersections; supports must avoid puncturing the primary barrier and introducing new leakage paths. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Positioning support and cover” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「定位支撐與覆蓋」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Positioning support and cover”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-17-k1","title":"定位支撐與覆蓋","titleEn":"Positioning support and cover","text":"止水帶需在澆置期間保持中心位置與足夠埋入深度，偏移會縮短繞流路徑或露出翼緣。幾何覆蓋扣減可示範誤差餘量，但還需考慮轉角和施工接續；支撐方式不可任意穿刺主要止水區造成新滲漏點。","textEn":"The strip must retain its center and embedment during placement. Displacement shortens bypass paths or exposes ribs.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「定位支撐與覆蓋」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Positioning support and cover\" is correct?","options":["澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變","止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水","止水帶需在澆置期間保持中心位置與足夠埋入深度，偏移會縮短繞流路徑或露出翼緣。"],"optionsEn":["Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting","An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak","The strip must retain its center and embedment during placement."],"answer":2,"explanation":"止水帶需在澆置期間保持中心位置與足夠埋入深度，偏移會縮短繞流路徑或露出翼緣。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The strip must retain its center and embedment during placement. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"b252-v15-18","title":"定位支撐與覆蓋：定量估算","titleEn":"Positioning support and cover: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「定位支撐與覆蓋」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Positioning support and cover” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「定位支撐與覆蓋」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Positioning support and cover\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm。","自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力","壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm.","Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure","A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: nominalEmbedment=150 mm; positioningError=25 mm; remainingEmbedment=150-25=125 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"b252-v15-19","title":"定位支撐與覆蓋：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Positioning support and cover: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「定位支撐與覆蓋」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Positioning support and cover” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-19-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「定位支撐與覆蓋」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Positioning support and cover\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點。","止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports.","Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile"],"answer":1,"explanation":"澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"b252-v15-20","title":"定位支撐與覆蓋：失效診斷","titleEn":"Positioning support and cover: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「定位支撐與覆蓋」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Positioning support and cover” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙。診斷時應採取以下查核：澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. Diagnose it by the following check: Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙。診斷時應採取以下查核：澆置前後量測中心線與埋入尺寸並記錄固定點，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. Diagnose it by the following check: Survey centerline and embedment before and after placement and record supports. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「定位支撐與覆蓋」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Positioning support and cover\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水","澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak","Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids."],"answer":2,"explanation":"澆置沖擊使止水帶翻折會形成隱藏連通空隙。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Placement impact can fold the strip and create concealed connected voids. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"b252-v15-21","title":"混凝土包覆與空洞：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Concrete encapsulation and voids: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-20"],"objective":"說明「混凝土包覆與空洞」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Concrete encapsulation and voids” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"止水翼緣周圍混凝土需充分密實，蜂窩會讓水繞過完整材料本體。空洞體積帳只能量化缺陷大小，連通性與位置才決定滲漏路徑；應結合澆置方向、振實可達性與適用檢測，不能以材料出廠合格取代包覆品質。 驗證時應檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測，並辨識以下失效情境：帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「混凝土包覆與空洞」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Concrete must encapsulate the ribs without honeycombing that lets water bypass an intact strip. Void volume measures size, while connectivity and location determine leakage. Combine placement sequence, consolidation access and suitable inspection; product certification does not establish the quality of surrounding concrete. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Concrete encapsulation and voids” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3.","failure":"常見誤解：「止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「混凝土包覆與空洞」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Concrete encapsulation and voids”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-21-k1","title":"混凝土包覆與空洞","titleEn":"Concrete encapsulation and voids","text":"止水翼緣周圍混凝土需充分密實，蜂窩會讓水繞過完整材料本體。空洞體積帳只能量化缺陷大小，連通性與位置才決定滲漏路徑；應結合澆置方向、振實可達性與適用檢測，不能以材料出廠合格取代包覆品質。","textEn":"Concrete must encapsulate the ribs without honeycombing that lets water bypass an intact strip. Void volume measures size, while connectivity and location determine leakage.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「混凝土包覆與空洞」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Concrete encapsulation and voids\" is correct?","options":["止水翼緣周圍混凝土需充分密實，蜂窩會讓水繞過完整材料本體。","止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水","任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律"],"optionsEn":["Concrete must encapsulate the ribs without honeycombing that lets water bypass an intact strip.","An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak","Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law"],"answer":0,"explanation":"止水翼緣周圍混凝土需充分密實，蜂窩會讓水繞過完整材料本體。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Concrete must encapsulate the ribs without honeycombing that lets water bypass an intact strip. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"b252-v15-22","title":"混凝土包覆與空洞：定量估算","titleEn":"Concrete encapsulation and voids: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「混凝土包覆與空洞」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Concrete encapsulation and voids” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「混凝土包覆與空洞」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Concrete encapsulation and voids\", which statement holds?","options":["修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉","原創教學假設：Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3。","附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差"],"optionsEn":["A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed","Original teaching assumptions: Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3.","Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Rectangular illustrative void: length=0.8 m; height=0.04 m; width=0.03 m; volume=0.8*0.04*0.03=0.00096 m3. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"b252-v15-23","title":"混凝土包覆與空洞：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Concrete encapsulation and voids: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「混凝土包覆與空洞」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Concrete encapsulation and voids” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-23-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「混凝土包覆與空洞」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Concrete encapsulation and voids\"?","options":["只要結構分析模型看起來合理，就可以省略現場量測與試驗。","自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開","檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測。"],"optionsEn":["If the structural model looks reasonable, site measurement and testing can be skipped.","Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field","Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately."],"answer":2,"explanation":"檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"b252-v15-24","title":"混凝土包覆與空洞：失效診斷","titleEn":"Concrete encapsulation and voids: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「混凝土包覆與空洞」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Concrete encapsulation and voids” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶。診斷時應採取以下查核：檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. Diagnose it by the following check: Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶。診斷時應採取以下查核：檢查止水帶下方振實可達性並對疑似蜂窩作適用探測，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. Diagnose it by the following check: Check consolidation access below the strip and investigate suspected honeycombing appropriately. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「混凝土包覆與空洞」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Concrete encapsulation and voids\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶。","只要結構還沒倒，就代表安全餘裕仍然足夠。","任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律"],"optionsEn":["Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier.","As long as the structure is still standing, its safety margin must still be adequate.","Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law"],"answer":0,"explanation":"帶下連續蜂窩可讓水完全繞過未損壞的止水帶。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Continuous honeycombing beneath the strip lets water bypass an undamaged barrier. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"b252-v15-s4","title":"試驗、量測與監測驗證","titleEn":"Testing, measurement and monitoring","description":"本階段聚焦「狹縫層流與敏感度」與「材料膨脹與拘束」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Slot flow and sensitivity\" and \"Material swelling and restraint\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b252-v15-25","title":"狹縫層流與敏感度：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Slot flow and sensitivity: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-24"],"objective":"說明「狹縫層流與敏感度」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Slot flow and sensitivity” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"平行板層流模型顯示縫隙開度對流量有立方影響，細小位移也可能明顯改變滲漏。此式限於光滑平行板、牛頓流體及層流，實際粗糙接縫可能有接觸點與曲折流路；應用它辨識敏感度而非預測未查明裂縫的精確漏量。 驗證時應比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流，並辨識以下失效情境：將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「狹縫層流與敏感度」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Parallel-plate laminar flow has cubic sensitivity to aperture, so small opening changes can strongly affect leakage. The relation assumes smooth parallel walls, a Newtonian fluid and laminar conditions. Rough contacts and tortuous joints violate these assumptions; use it for sensitivity rather than exact leakage prediction. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Slot flow and sensitivity” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「狹縫層流與敏感度」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Slot flow and sensitivity”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-25-k1","title":"狹縫層流與敏感度","titleEn":"Slot flow and sensitivity","text":"平行板層流模型顯示縫隙開度對流量有立方影響，細小位移也可能明顯改變滲漏。此式限於光滑平行板、牛頓流體及層流，實際粗糙接縫可能有接觸點與曲折流路；應用它辨識敏感度而非預測未查明裂縫的精確漏量。","textEn":"Parallel-plate laminar flow has cubic sensitivity to aperture, so small opening changes can strongly affect leakage. The relation assumes smooth parallel walls, a Newtonian fluid and laminar conditions.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「狹縫層流與敏感度」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Slot flow and sensitivity\" is correct?","options":["任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律","平行板層流模型顯示縫隙開度對流量有立方影響，細小位移也可能明顯改變滲漏。","自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力"],"optionsEn":["Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law","Parallel-plate laminar flow has cubic sensitivity to aperture, so small opening changes can strongly affect leakage.","Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"平行板層流模型顯示縫隙開度對流量有立方影響，細小位移也可能明顯改變滲漏。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Parallel-plate laminar flow has cubic sensitivity to aperture, so small opening changes can strongly affect leakage. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"b252-v15-26","title":"狹縫層流與敏感度：定量估算","titleEn":"Slot flow and sensitivity: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「狹縫層流與敏感度」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Slot flow and sensitivity” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「狹縫層流與敏感度」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Slot flow and sensitivity\", which statement holds?","options":["壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出","止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度","原創教學假設：width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s。"],"optionsEn":["A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked","Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile","Original teaching assumptions: width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: width=0.1 m; gap=0.0002 m; deltaP=1000 Pa; mu=0.001 Pa*s; length=1 m; Q=0.1*0.0002**3*1000/(12*0.001*1)=0.0000000666667 m3/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"b252-v15-27","title":"狹縫層流與敏感度：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Slot flow and sensitivity: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「狹縫層流與敏感度」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Slot flow and sensitivity” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-27-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「狹縫層流與敏感度」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Slot flow and sensitivity\"?","options":["比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流。","量測時不必記錄溫度、水頭、水位歷程與施工荷重，因為它們不會影響結果。","接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合"],"optionsEn":["Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability.","Temperature, water head, water-level history and construction loads need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section"],"answer":0,"explanation":"比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"b252-v15-28","title":"狹縫層流與敏感度：失效診斷","titleEn":"Slot flow and sensitivity: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「狹縫層流與敏感度」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Slot flow and sensitivity” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較同壓差下漏量對開度的變化並確認是否仍為層流，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare leakage versus opening at fixed pressure difference and check laminar applicability. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「狹縫層流與敏感度」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Slot flow and sensitivity\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自施工人員失誤，設計與細部不需要檢討。","將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量。","自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is a workmanship error, so design and detailing never need review.","Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage.","Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure"],"answer":1,"explanation":"將立方律延用至湍流大縫隙會錯估漏量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Extending the cubic law to a large turbulent gap misstates leakage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"b252-v15-29","title":"材料膨脹與拘束：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Material swelling and restraint: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-28"],"objective":"說明「材料膨脹與拘束」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Material swelling and restraint” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"膨潤型材料遇水增大體積，但拘束空間與化學環境會影響密封效果及對混凝土的作用。自由膨脹比不是受拘束壓力，不能由體積直接換算力；需依產品相容性、預膨潤控制與代表性接縫試驗確認適用。 驗證時應比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤，並辨識以下失效情境：澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「材料膨脹與拘束」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Hydrophilic materials expand in water, but confinement and chemistry control sealing and concrete interaction. Free swelling ratio is not restrained pressure and cannot be converted directly into force. Evaluate compatibility, premature swelling control and representative joint tests using product-specific information. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Material swelling and restraint” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent.","failure":"常見誤解：「自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「材料膨脹與拘束」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Material swelling and restraint”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-29-k1","title":"材料膨脹與拘束","titleEn":"Material swelling and restraint","text":"膨潤型材料遇水增大體積，但拘束空間與化學環境會影響密封效果及對混凝土的作用。自由膨脹比不是受拘束壓力，不能由體積直接換算力；需依產品相容性、預膨潤控制與代表性接縫試驗確認適用。","textEn":"Hydrophilic materials expand in water, but confinement and chemistry control sealing and concrete interaction. Free swelling ratio is not restrained pressure and cannot be converted directly into force.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「材料膨脹與拘束」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Material swelling and restraint\" is correct?","options":["自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力","修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉","膨潤型材料遇水增大體積，但拘束空間與化學環境會影響密封效果及對混凝土的作用。"],"optionsEn":["Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure","A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed","Hydrophilic materials expand in water, but confinement and chemistry control sealing and concrete interaction."],"answer":2,"explanation":"膨潤型材料遇水增大體積，但拘束空間與化學環境會影響密封效果及對混凝土的作用。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Hydrophilic materials expand in water, but confinement and chemistry control sealing and concrete interaction. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"b252-v15-30","title":"材料膨脹與拘束：定量估算","titleEn":"Material swelling and restraint: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「材料膨脹與拘束」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Material swelling and restraint” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「材料膨脹與拘束」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Material swelling and restraint\", which statement holds?","options":["原創教學假設：initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent。","附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差","自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開"],"optionsEn":["Original teaching assumptions: initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent.","Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location","Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field"],"answer":0,"explanation":"原創教學假設：initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: initialVolume=100 cm3; freeSwollenVolume=160 cm3; freeVolumeIncrease=(160-100)/100*100=60 percent. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"b252-v15-31","title":"材料膨脹與拘束：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Material swelling and restraint: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「材料膨脹與拘束」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Material swelling and restraint” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-31-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「材料膨脹與拘束」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Material swelling and restraint\"?","options":["沿用另一處水工設施或流域的量測結果，就可視為本工程已完成驗證。","比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤。","澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another hydraulic structure or catchment counts as verifying this structure.","Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion.","Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting"],"answer":1,"explanation":"比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"b252-v15-32","title":"材料膨脹與拘束：失效診斷","titleEn":"Material swelling and restraint: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「材料膨脹與拘束」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Material swelling and restraint” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「自由膨脹百分比可以直接換成密封接觸壓力」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Free swelling percentage directly converts into sealing contact pressure\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量。診斷時應採取以下查核：比較實際水質下自由膨脹與受拘束試驗並檢查預膨潤，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare free and confined swelling in representative water and inspect premature expansion. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「材料膨脹與拘束」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Material swelling and restraint\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["補一層塗料或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數劣化問題。","修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉","澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量。"],"optionsEn":["Adding a coat of paint or widening the acceptance limits solves most deterioration problems.","A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed","Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve."],"answer":2,"explanation":"澆置前先膨脹可能降低後續可用變形餘量。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Swelling before concreting can reduce subsequent accommodation reserve. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4},{"id":"b252-v15-s5","title":"耐久、維護與工程交接","titleEn":"Durability, maintenance and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「分區漏量與定位」與「壓力保持與量測誤差」：先建立機制、系統路徑與定量模型，再設計試驗驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Zoned leakage and localization\" and \"Pressure holding and measurement error\": establish the mechanism, system paths and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"b252-v15-33","title":"分區漏量與定位：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Zoned leakage and localization: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-32"],"objective":"說明「分區漏量與定位」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Zoned leakage and localization” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"接縫漏水應分區收集並與水位及溫度同步，總漏量下降可能只是流路轉移而非修補成功。量測容積除時間提供直接流量，但集水效率與暫態蓄水仍需核對；染色或其他定位方法也須符合水質與工程程序。 驗證時應以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率，並辨識以下失效情境：只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「分區漏量與定位」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Collect joint leakage by zone and align it with head and temperature. A lower total may reflect pathway diversion rather than successful repair. Timed volume gives discharge directly, but collection efficiency and transient storage still matter; localization methods must follow the relevant engineering and water-quality procedures. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Zoned leakage and localization” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s.","failure":"常見誤解：「修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「分區漏量與定位」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Zoned leakage and localization”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-33-k1","title":"分區漏量與定位","titleEn":"Zoned leakage and localization","text":"接縫漏水應分區收集並與水位及溫度同步，總漏量下降可能只是流路轉移而非修補成功。量測容積除時間提供直接流量，但集水效率與暫態蓄水仍需核對；染色或其他定位方法也須符合水質與工程程序。","textEn":"Collect joint leakage by zone and align it with head and temperature. A lower total may reflect pathway diversion rather than successful repair.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-33-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「分區漏量與定位」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Zoned leakage and localization\" is correct?","options":["接縫漏水應分區收集並與水位及溫度同步，總漏量下降可能只是流路轉移而非修補成功。","修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉","壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出"],"optionsEn":["Collect joint leakage by zone and align it with head and temperature.","A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed","A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked"],"answer":0,"explanation":"接縫漏水應分區收集並與水位及溫度同步，總漏量下降可能只是流路轉移而非修補成功。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Collect joint leakage by zone and align it with head and temperature. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":33},{"id":"b252-v15-34","title":"分區漏量與定位：定量估算","titleEn":"Zoned leakage and localization: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-33"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「分區漏量與定位」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Zoned leakage and localization” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-34-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-34-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「分區漏量與定位」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Zoned leakage and localization\", which statement holds?","options":["止水帶總寬度就是所有型式的有效拉伸長度","原創教學假設：CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s。","接頭表面平整就證明整個斷面完全熔合"],"optionsEn":["Total waterstop width is the active stretch length for every profile","Original teaching assumptions: CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s.","A smooth splice surface proves complete fusion through the section"],"answer":1,"explanation":"原創教學假設：CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: CollectedVolume=18 L; elapsed=120 s; localLeakRate=18/120=0.15 L/s. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":34},{"id":"b252-v15-35","title":"分區漏量與定位：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Zoned leakage and localization: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-34"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「分區漏量與定位」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Zoned leakage and localization” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-35-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-35-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「分區漏量與定位」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Zoned leakage and localization\"?","options":["只看一次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準點、參考試體或重複量測。","止水帶本體完好就保證接縫一定不漏水","以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the work; no datum, reference specimen or repeat measurement is needed.","An intact waterstop guarantees that the joint cannot leak","Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency."],"answer":2,"explanation":"以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":35},{"id":"b252-v15-36","title":"分區漏量與定位：失效診斷","titleEn":"Zoned leakage and localization: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-35"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「分區漏量與定位」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Zoned leakage and localization” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫。診斷時應採取以下查核：以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「修補點不滴水就證明整個接縫水路已封閉」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A dry repair point proves that the entire joint pathway is sealed\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-36-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫。診斷時應採取以下查核：以相同水頭比較修補區及相鄰區漏量並核對集水效率，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. Diagnose it by the following check: Compare repaired and adjacent zones at matching head and verify collection efficiency. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-36-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「分區漏量與定位」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Zoned leakage and localization\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫。","裂縫或異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出"],"optionsEn":["A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint.","A crack or anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked"],"answer":0,"explanation":"只看修補點乾燥可能漏掉滲流轉往相鄰接縫。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A dry repaired point can conceal diversion into an adjacent joint. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":9,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":36},{"id":"b252-v15-37","title":"壓力保持與量測誤差：機制與系統路徑","titleEn":"Pressure holding and measurement error: mechanism and system paths","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-36"],"objective":"說明「壓力保持與量測誤差」如何影響大壩止水帶施工的受力、變形、水流或訊號表現，並畫出相關輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pressure holding and measurement error” governs forces, deformation, flow or signals in “Dam waterstop installation”, and map the relevant inputs, transfer paths and boundaries.","instruction":"封閉水路壓力試驗需分辨漏水、溫度與系統柔度造成的壓力變化，壓降不直接等於漏量。若以已率定體積柔度換算，只在小變形且溫度穩定時成立；應保留水溫、補水量及壓力校正，避免單一壓力曲線過度推論。 驗證時應核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降，並辨識以下失效情境：溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失。這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。 師傅任務：以自由體圖、流路圖或訊號圖畫出相關物理量如何經過「壓力保持與量測誤差」傳到系統邊界，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由材料、施工或環境決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"A pressure-hold test must separate leakage from temperature and system compliance. Pressure drop is not directly a leak rate. Conversion through calibrated volumetric compliance assumes small changes and stable temperature; retain temperature, makeup volume and calibration records before interpreting one pressure trace. Test this interpretation with the following evidence: Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. In particular, distinguish this failure mechanism: Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid. Mentor task: draw a free-body, flow or signal diagram showing how relevant physical quantities pass through “Pressure holding and measurement error” to the system boundary, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by materials, construction or environment, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：原創教學假設：Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Original teaching assumptions: Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption.","failure":"常見誤解：「壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在系統圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your system diagram where it breaks down.","check":"系統圖標明「壓力保持與量測誤差」的輸入、傳遞路徑與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The system diagram shows inputs, transfer paths and boundaries for “Pressure holding and measurement error”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-37-k1","title":"壓力保持與量測誤差","titleEn":"Pressure holding and measurement error","text":"封閉水路壓力試驗需分辨漏水、溫度與系統柔度造成的壓力變化，壓降不直接等於漏量。若以已率定體積柔度換算，只在小變形且溫度穩定時成立；應保留水溫、補水量及壓力校正，避免單一壓力曲線過度推論。","textEn":"A pressure-hold test must separate leakage from temperature and system compliance. Pressure drop is not directly a leak rate.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-37-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出 正確的工程判斷必須回到傳力機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked Sound engineering judgement goes back to the load path and magnitude.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「壓力保持與量測誤差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pressure holding and measurement error\" is correct?","options":["壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出","封閉水路壓力試驗需分辨漏水、溫度與系統柔度造成的壓力變化，壓降不直接等於漏量。","附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差"],"optionsEn":["A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked","A pressure-hold test must separate leakage from temperature and system compliance.","Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location"],"answer":1,"explanation":"封閉水路壓力試驗需分辨漏水、溫度與系統柔度造成的壓力變化，壓降不直接等於漏量。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"A pressure-hold test must separate leakage from temperature and system compliance. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":37},{"id":"b252-v15-38","title":"壓力保持與量測誤差：定量估算","titleEn":"Pressure holding and measurement error: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-37"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「壓力保持與量測誤差」的關鍵量，並判斷幾何、水頭、荷載或材料參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pressure holding and measurement error” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of change when geometry, water head, load or material parameters move.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：原創教學假設：Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係，並指出規範或設計上通常如何處理這個敏感度。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Original teaching assumptions: Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper, and note how codes or designers usually handle this sensitivity.","observation":"如何核對：核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成真實設計值、混淆標稱值與設計值（未乘載重或強度係數），或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit slips, treating teaching assumptions as real design values, mixing nominal and factored values, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"依模型顯示精度重現數值，列出單位與取整方式，並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與工程解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values to their displayed precision, state units and rounding, and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with an engineering explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-38-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"原創教學假設：Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption。數值只檢查量綱與機制，不是實測資料、設計設定或允收門檻。","textEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption. These values check dimensions and mechanism, not measured data, design settings or acceptance thresholds.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-38-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設或公開資料的簡化；套用到實際工程前，必須依規範荷載組合、材料試驗與現場量測重新計算並由技師簽證。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions or simplified public data; before applying them to a real structure, recalculate with code load combinations, material tests and site measurements, certified by a qualified engineer.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「壓力保持與量測誤差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pressure holding and measurement error\", which statement holds?","options":["自由熱縮算值必定等於現場實測接縫張開","澆置前定位正確就保證澆置後位置不變","原創教學假設：Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption。"],"optionsEn":["Calculated free contraction must equal measured joint opening in the field","Correct preplacement positioning guarantees no movement during concreting","Original teaching assumptions: Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa."],"answer":2,"explanation":"原創教學假設：Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Original teaching assumptions: Calibrated systemCompliance=0.002 L/kPa; pressureDrop=15 kPa; inferredVolumeChange=0.002*15=0.030 L; isothermal small-change assumption. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":38},{"id":"b252-v15-39","title":"壓力保持與量測誤差：試驗與驗證","titleEn":"Pressure holding and measurement error: testing and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-38"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的試驗、量測或檢查，驗證「壓力保持與量測誤差」是否符合模型與規範預期，並在量測前訂出允收準則與停工點。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable test, measurement or inspection that verifies whether “Pressure holding and measurement error” meets the model and code expectation, fixing acceptance criteria and hold points before measuring.","instruction":"核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成試驗或量測計畫，列出儀器與感測器、基準點或參考試體、步驟、比較對象、允收準則與停工點，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted. Mentor task: turn this into a test or measurement plan listing instruments and sensors, datums or reference specimens, procedure, comparison baseline, acceptance criteria and hold points, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"現場實務：交接時以核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","observationEn":"Site practice: At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","failure":"注意干擾：溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失。 只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄溫度、水頭與施工荷重，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Watch for interference: Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. A single reading, no traceable datum, or unrecorded temperature, water head and construction loads make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交試驗或量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則、停工點與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格、由誰簽認。","checkEn":"Submit the test or measurement plan: instruments, datums, procedure, acceptance criteria, hold points and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail rule and who signs it off.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-39-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降。應將原始量測與本單元模型的輸入條件對齊，並針對「溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失」取得獨立證據；同時保留儀器校正、測點位置與時間，避免把不同工況的資料直接相減。","textEn":"Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Match raw observations to the input conditions of this unit and obtain independent evidence for this specific scenario: Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. Preserve calibration, location and timing so that unlike operating states are not directly subtracted.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-39-k2","title":"現場實務","titleEn":"Site practice","text":"交接時以核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降作為可追溯證據，保存對應材料、構形與工況版本。針對溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失，由負責工程師設定需補驗的項目與停留點，不能把教學結果當作現場操作許可。","textEn":"At handover, use the following traceable evidence: Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Record material, geometry and operating-state versions. Address this scenario: Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. The responsible engineer defines additional checks and hold points; the teaching result is not field operating authorization.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「壓力保持與量測誤差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pressure holding and measurement error\"?","options":["核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","任何粗糙接縫都完全遵守光滑平行板立方律"],"optionsEn":["Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Every rough joint exactly follows the smooth parallel-plate cubic law"],"answer":0,"explanation":"核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降。 驗證需要基準、重複性與事先訂定的允收準則。","explanationEn":"Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Verification needs a datum, repeatability and acceptance criteria fixed in advance."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":39},{"id":"b252-v15-40","title":"壓力保持與量測誤差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pressure holding and measurement error: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"prerequisiteIds":["b252-v15-39"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「壓力保持與量測誤差」的失效或劣化原因，提出能區分原因的檢查、矯正與預防措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure or deterioration causes of “Pressure holding and measurement error” and propose discriminating checks, corrective actions and prevention.","instruction":"溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失。診斷時應採取以下查核：核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測或檢測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整體結構的安全、使用性、耐久或營運。","instructionEn":"Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. Diagnose it by the following check: Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement or inspection that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-structure safety, serviceability, durability or operation.","observation":"連結機制：這有助於確認模型的水流、受力或量測邊界是否仍成立。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: That distinction determines whether the model boundary or measurement assumption remains valid.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「壓力下降就必定表示相同量的水已漏出」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A pressure drop necessarily means a corresponding amount of water has leaked\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，指出哪一項量測或檢測能最快確認根因、需要哪些人簽認，以及如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement or inspection that confirms the root cause fastest, who must sign off, and how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"b252-v15-40-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失。診斷時應採取以下查核：核對水溫與系統柔度並以補水體積交叉驗證壓降，確認異常是否同時出現在相關量測；未釐清原因就調整門檻，會使真正的機制變化被資料處理掩蓋。","textEn":"Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. Diagnose it by the following check: Check water temperature and system compliance and cross-check pressure loss using makeup volume. Establish whether related measurements corroborate the anomaly; changing thresholds before identifying the cause can conceal a real change in the governing mechanism.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]},{"id":"b252-v15-40-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測或檢測確認；只補強外觀、更換構件或放寬允收值可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement or inspection; cosmetic repair, swapping components or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「壓力保持與量測誤差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pressure holding and measurement error\" shows distress, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的構件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失。","附近水深就等於接縫每一位置的實際壓差"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive component first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage.","Nearby water depth equals actual pressure difference at every joint location"],"answer":1,"explanation":"溫降造成的壓力降低可能被誤判為止水漏失。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Cooling-induced pressure reduction can be mistaken for leakage. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":10,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":40}],"order":5}],"sourceIds":["b-src-water-manuals","v15s-usbr-joints","v15s-usbr-waterstop-collab","v15s-sika-waterstops","v15s-glen-owner"],"curriculumVersion":15,"stepCount":40,"estimatedMinutes":1000}};
